{"id":"en_goodbye-mr-foster","title":"Goodbye, Mr. Foster","titleEn":"Goodbye, Mr. Foster","description":"Following her release from the hospital after giving birth, Samantha Blake discovered Daniel Foster allowing Allison Turner, an intern who closely resembled his first love, to behave beyond her place. Rather than showing any regret, Daniel permitted Allison to provoke Samantha repeatedly. Once she had had enough, Samantha made her divorce filing public and, at the baby's one-month celebration, pulled out all her investments, striking the Foster Group a serious blow. When Allison's plot came to light, Daniel finally understood the years of quiet devotion Samantha had given him and the reality of his own infertility. He went down on his knees to plead for a second chance, but she turned him down and moved forward into a new life with her child.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/goodbye-mr-foster/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/goodbye-mr-foster/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Avenge","Betrayal","Elite","Her Journey","Heroine","Sweet Revenge"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7din7y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_goodbye-mr-foster_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7din7y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_goodbye-mr-foster_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7din7y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_goodbye-mr-foster_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7din7y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},